    notificationText: "COMMAND: \nSearch and rescue operation authorized.\nLocate
      Astronaut Ward. Last known position: Outpost 03."
  - message: 1
    notificationText: 'Equipment recommended.

      Retrieve maintenance wrench
      before departure.'
  - message: 2
    notificationText: "COMMAND: \nVisual confirmation received.\nAstronaut Ward remains
