  - message: 5
    notificationText: "COMMAND: \nPower restored. \nInitializing communications array."
  - message: 6
    notificationText: 'Transmission established.

      Telemetry upload in progress.'
  - message: 7
    notificationText: "Data received. \nProceed to Main Habitat for further instructions."
  - message: 8
    notificationText: "COMMAND: \nYou are within operational range of Main Habitat."
  - message: 9
    notificationText: "COMMAND: \nMission update available. \nAccess terminal."
  - message: 10
    notificationText: 'OBJECTIVE UPDATED.

      Geological survey authorized.

      Retrieve
